{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/66910c86800cdb69e1fdb1aad34e3616.avif?t=1768704670\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D.R.I.F.T. is a slow-paced space sandbox where you play as an independent pilot navigating a fragmented and ever-changing galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept contracts, travel between star systems, explore anomalies, rescue stranded ships, transport cargo, and take part in colonization projects while upgrading your ship and managing your resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t lead empires or command fleets.<br>There is no predetermined story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is shaped by your decisions, the missions you choose, and how much risk you\u2019re willing to take on each journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/9a97e0c44a4b5b122bf7236479db4a67.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1408 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living, Reactive Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events, factions, markets and rumors evolve with or without you.<br>Every jump feels different because the galaxy refuses to sit still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/329f1ffb4af9758fa10e85606f168d9e.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/104cefd0b490914e411cbe09c26e8c5c.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Journey, Your Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide what type of pilot you become:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smuggler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvager</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just a wandering opportunist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no fixed path, only the one you carve through deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/86c0f3e28fe5107f99e27197afd85002.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1408 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Dynamic Markets, Contracts &amp; Jobs</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport cargo</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue distressed colonies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine asteroids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage derelict ships</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/e6cc82c13970c081cbb137a42b4797cc.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every contract has risks, rewards, and consequences for your reputation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variable Economy &amp; Markets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Markets shift. Jobs pay differently. Conditions change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/1cabcbc760af26836346b858ae00d666.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/91cceea7b5444c836d80114c59ec6696.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1408 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through interconnected systems, discover new routes, find anomalies, stumble upon derelicts and remote stations. Procedural generation keeps each run fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/bdb4a578f85ba33834b8eacb275f14c9.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/a6709309518d2f6a1ce0c6c1c0410c9b.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/5b4cca5c27c9f016062028c2c53af6db.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Ship Is Your Lifeline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power management, CPU usage, module selection and fuel efficiency define your survival more than firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single poor decision can leave you drifting in the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/adece433ba84735299ccc3b3db0cb1db.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/745ca3a9e28e40045f129cf65de7c5e2.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Makes D.R.I.F.T. Unique</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True sandbox freedom\u2014no scripted main campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A galaxy shaped by systems, not pre-written events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple viable playstyles: trader, miner, explorer, smuggler, scavenger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent consequences with faction diplomacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emphasis on survival, choices and resource management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every session becomes your own story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/6139f4e6e224ea2f3e3c08e7e3031d7d.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>D.R.I.F.T. is about carving your path through an unforgiving universe.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, prosper, or burn out in the black.<br>The galaxy doesn't care, but your legacy will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/8c777bd2ae8fe47279b174d674d4e69e.avif?t=1768704670\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Generative AI was used during the production of this game. The game does not use AI at any point during its execution.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Delivery Boy of the Stars","path":